  "content": "<h2>开场白</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1900847448211067390\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"倾尽全力去「敷衍」\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-488304083a838c3bd2db7d5c5de218ce.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">倾尽全力去「敷衍」</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1901765420047925380\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"破罐破摔\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">破罐破摔</a><h2>第一部分：为某事而奋斗</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1903383938082279971\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"超越内疚\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">超越内疚</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1905196194822625036\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"邮票收集者\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">邮票收集者</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1905565340240421282\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"你可以为某些事而奋斗\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">你可以为某些事而奋斗</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1910305606822240387\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"关心比自己更宏大的事\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">关心比自己更宏大的事</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1914251374457235057\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"你无法确知自己在为了什么奋斗\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-a1127fa249b90bacaf835668cab6e8e8.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">你无法确知自己在为了什么奋斗</a><h2>第二部分：抛开你的义务</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1916181681422960007\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"「应该」一词的危害\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">「应该」一词的危害</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1918282993136563559\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"别因为你「应该」\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">别因为你「应该」</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1918280804708124166\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"你的「应该」不是一项义务\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">你的「应该」不是一项义务</a><h2>第三部分：半猴，半神</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1926213898798871853\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"拼命工作并非美德\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">拼命工作并非美德</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1926221776146396166\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"休息，应在行动之中\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">休息，应在行动之中</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1929508324510003381\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"转移内疚感\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">转移内疚感</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1930925755644223747\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"别用内疚感操控人生\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">别用内疚感操控人生</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1933134101705102466\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"猛击后的醒悟与更新\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">猛击后的醒悟与更新</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1934180803157395345\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"更新自我\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">更新自我</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1935273252781007870\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"尚非神明\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">尚非神明</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1937122225049272877\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"「本可以」的时机\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">「本可以」的时机</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1939717823703278714\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"自我关怀\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-913c007502797a70963b7c41302f5722.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">自我关怀</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1941792108211054104\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"世上没有「坏人」\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">世上没有「坏人」</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1944131629204346775\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"立足凡间\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">立足凡间</a><h2>第四部分：黑暗世界</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1946505224375206434\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"无法绝望\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">无法绝望</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1954836809650505396\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"直面黑暗世界\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">直面黑暗世界</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1956414343680878194\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"无痛选择\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">无痛选择</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1960275727002895369\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"卸下凝重指数计\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">卸下凝重指数计</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1962132424247981610\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"只需为自己定位\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">只需为自己定位</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1967550776080590264\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"没有借口\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">没有借口</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1973738182160954006\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"达成和解\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">达成和解</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1975532011516104972\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"化内疚为决心\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">化内疚为决心</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1977309653412107584\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"你所能做到的最好\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">你所能做到的最好</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1979133219929621200\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"黑暗，但并非没有色彩\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">黑暗，但并非没有色彩</a><h2>第五部分：内心之火</h2><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1980993626159986184\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"停止「努力去尝试」，直接去尝试\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">停止「努力去尝试」，直接去尝试</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1982829037010301857\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"没有「试试」一说\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-247d8d9e4af0e15695dfcafa62247ac3.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">没有「试试」一说</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1994004399278794323\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"显而易见的建议\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">显而易见的建议</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1999245045270865749\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"回应的艺术\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">回应的艺术</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1999514459417362962\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"全力阶梯覆盖式自信\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">全力阶梯覆盖式自信</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2004618843809682596\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"拼命\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">拼命</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2009342379862280068\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"鲁莽\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">鲁莽</a><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2013698640993068681\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"反抗\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">反抗</a><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2015014462667628594\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"我们将如何被衡量\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5bbc277fcb0685054f867df8f09b630f.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=